WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.113
Repair an agreement that sounds finished An agreement can

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:07.928
look finished while hiding a serious gap Look for

00:00:07.942 --> 00:00:12.442
unlimited duties assumed monitoring payment rights that were not

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:18.468
delegated and automatic after-hours availability Replace each vague promise

00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:22.336
with defined work conditions an owner and the required

00:00:22.402 --> 00:00:26.534
confirmation A clause that honestly records a limit or

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:30.482
an unknown is not defective for that reason Select

00:00:30.521 --> 00:00:34.047
every clause needing correction explain one repair in your

00:00:34.087 --> 00:00:34.876
own words
